  "ruleText": "Csp 302.04 No Investment Direction. The trust documents shall prohibit each of the participant and the designated beneficiary from directing the investment of any amounts held in an account.\n\nSource. #7083, eff 8-26-99, EXPIRED: 8-26-07\n\nNew. #9585, eff 11-2-09; ss by #11097, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
